From: =?UTF-8?q?Pablo=20De=20Andr=C3=A9s?= <pdeandres35@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 15:21:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(web): close the LAN pairing contract gaps found in
 review

Enforce the `application/x-www-form-urlencoded` media type the README and the
Agent Note already claimed, answering 415 before the body is read. Move the PIN
exchange off the public `HostConnectionHandle`: the registered `/pair` route is
its only caller and the host/origin fence that must precede it stays there, so
the handle no longer widens with a method nothing outside the package uses.

Pin the shipped pairing defaults through observable behavior, cover an empty or
non-numeric PIN, assert the pairing cookie's full attribute chain, and prove the
`/pair` route is removed with the fiber.
